id: fonts-pick
section: Fonts
item: Settings → Content → Fonts & Colors: pick a Serif font from the list — the pref is written; Restore default fonts clears it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-preferences-ui.md R9
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="content"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="content"]' 5
wait rect fonts-reset 5
pick 'sel:.row[data-pref="font.name.serif.x-western"] select' 3 25
wait pref s font.name.serif.x-western Dotum 5
tap fonts-reset
wait text 'sel:#status' 'back to their defaults' 5
